WEBVTT

00:00:18.008 --> 00:00:21.090
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I’m tired. What time is it?

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:24.559
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> It’s eleven o’clock.

00:00:25.769 --> 00:00:29.300
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I need to go. I have a meeting in Oxford tomorrow morning.

00:00:30.411 --> 00:00:31.054
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> One more drink?

00:00:32.361 --> 00:00:33.399
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Oh, OK!

00:00:48.933 --> 00:00:51.292
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Excuse me. What time is it?

00:00:52.561 --> 00:00:56.823
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> It’s a quarter to eight. What time’s your train?

00:00:57.018 --> 00:00:58.724
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> At seven forty-seven.

00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:01.497
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> You need to hurry! You only have two minutes.

00:01:01.526 --> 00:01:02.198
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Thanks.

00:01:43.594 --> 00:01:47.235
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Hello. I’m Rob Walker. I’m sorry I’m late.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:51.891
<v><b>Man:</b></v> You’re an hour late. It’s half past ten.

00:01:52.054 --> 00:01:54.295
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I know. I’m really sorry.